<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines warns MUI hotel on wastewater.</title>
<headline>Philippines warns MUI hotel on wastewater.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines' environment department said on Thursday it had warned Shangrila EDSA Plaza Hotel, one of the hotels of MUI Resources Phils Inc, to improve its wastewater treatment plant or face immediate closure.</p>
<p>&quot;DENR (Department of Environment and Natural Resources) Secretary Victor Ramos ... gave the firm until February next year to set up its water treatment plant,&quot; the department said in a statement.</p>
<p>The department said the hotel did not pass the effluent standard set for hotels.</p>
<p>MUI officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
